# T119: PB Store does not remove itself: its detail page has no Remove, and the page names PB Installer on a computer.
# scenario updates
# expect-unchanged
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap search
waitfor searchField
tap searchField
type pbstore
key Return
waitfor searchSummary 1 of
tap appRow 0
waitfor detailState
expect_absent actionRemove
expect storeNote PB Installer
shot @OUT@/42-pb-store-detail.png
tap back
quit
